IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `tsia-investigations`

-- Transport Safety Investigations Act 2018, ss 5, 12, 15, 16, 19, 21, 29(4), 33, 36-38, 42 and the penalty provisions -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_transport-safety-investigations-act-2018.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

